+/**
+ * URL Regex Provider
+ *
+ * Detects plain text URLs on a single line using regex.
+ * Does not support multi-line URLs or file paths.
+ *
+ * Supported protocols:
+ * - https://, http://
+ * - mailto:
+ * - ftp://, ssh://, git://
